  m_Name: Evento_TrabalhadoresProtestamContraAutomacao
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Metis.Runtime::KnowledgeEntryData
  _title: "Trabalhadores Protestam contra Automa\xE7\xE3o"
  _titleEn: Workers Protest against Automation
  _category: 1
  _unlockTrigger: 0
  _summary: "M\xE1quinas e algoritmos substituem tarefas repetitivas, e os trabalhadores
    afetados reagem ao risco de perder o emprego."
  _summaryEn: Machines and algorithms replace repetitive tasks, and affected workers
    push back against the risk of losing their jobs.
  _realWorld: "Em outubro de 2024, estivadores dos portos da costa leste e do Golfo
    dos Estados Unidos fizeram greve, e limites \xE0 automa\xE7\xE3o foram um dos
    pontos centrais da negocia\xE7\xE3o."
  _realWorldEn: In October 2024, dockworkers at US East and Gulf Coast ports went
    on strike, and limits on automation were a central point of the negotiation.
  _tradeOffs: "Requalifica\xE7\xE3o, transi\xE7\xE3o gradual e divis\xE3o dos ganhos
    de produtividade reduzem o conflito."
  _tradeOffsEn: Retraining, gradual transition and sharing productivity gains reduce
    the conflict.
  _sources:
  - Label: 2024 United States port strike (Wikipedia)
    Url: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2024_United_States_port_strike
